{"id":"0cef240132db9207aea65516491444cc4047fd2a","axis":"silent","repo":"pnpm/pnpm","sha":"0cef240132db9207aea65516491444cc4047fd2a","parsed":{"files":[{"path":".changeset/injected-link-follows-peers.md","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@","+---","+\"@pnpm/installing.deps-resolver\": patch","+\"pnpm\": patch","+\"pacquet\": patch","+---","+","+An injected workspace package that was linked now becomes a copy when the project that depends on it starts providing one of its peers at a version the package's own workspace context lacks. The link used to stay until that dependency was updated, so the package could not find the peer the project provides [#17057](https://github.com/pnpm/pnpm/issues/17057)."],"additions":7,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/tests/suite/dedupe_injected_deps.rs","lines":["@@ -308,10 +308,9 @@ fn injected_peer_suffixed_workspace_dep_stays_file_after_remove() {","     drop((root, mock_instance));"," }"," ","-/// The pnpm/pnpm#10433 guard preserves an untargeted workspace dep's","-/// prior `link:`, but it only compensates for the dedupe pass not","-/// running on every re-resolution path — with that pass off the recorded","-/// entry is stale. Regression test for pnpm/pnpm#13754.","+/// With the dedupe pass off, nothing turns an injected workspace dep back","+/// into a `link:`, so a recorded `link:` gives way to the injected copy.","+/// Regression test for pnpm/pnpm#13754."," #[test]"," fn newly_injected_workspace_dep_with_dedupe_off_replaces_recorded_link() {","     let CommandTempCwd {","@@ -664,3 +663,51 @@ fn injected_workspace_dep_is_deduped_after_its_peer_variants_merge() {"," ","     drop((root, mock_instance));"," }","+","+/// `q` peer-depends on `@pnpm.e2e/foo`, and `n` depends on `q`. While only","+/// the root provides `foo`, `q` binds the same version under the consumer","+/// as in `n`'s own context, so `consumer -> n` dedupes to `link:`. Once the","+/// consumer provides another version, the injected copy binds that one, so","+/// the next install records the copy, as a fresh install does.","+/// Covers <https://github.com/pnpm/pnpm/issues/17057>.","+#[test]","+fn injected_workspace_dep_turns_into_a_copy_when_its_peer_diverges() {","+    let fixture = _utils::WorkspaceFixture::new();","+    fixture.append_workspace_yaml(\"injectWorkspacePackages: true\\n\");","+    let write = |dir: &str, manifest: serde_json::Value| {","+        let path = fixture.workspace.join(\"packages\").join(dir);","+        fs::create_dir_all(&path).expect(\"create project dir\");","+        fs::write(path.join(\"package.json\"), manifest.to_string()).expect(\"write package.json\");","+    };","+    fs::write(","+        fixture.workspace.join(\"package.json\"),","+        serde_json::json!({ \"name\": \"root\", \"dependencies\": { \"@pnpm.e2e/foo\": \"100.0.0\" } })","+            .to_string(),","+    )","+    .expect(\"write root package.json\");","+    write(\"q\", serde_json::json!({ \"name\": \"q\", \"peerDependencies\": { \"@pnpm.e2e/foo\": \"*\" } }));","+    write(\"n\", serde_json::json!({ \"name\": \"n\", \"dependencies\": { \"q\": \"workspace:^\" } }));","+    write(","+        \"consumer\",","+        serde_json::json!({ \"name\": \"consumer\", \"dependencies\": { \"n\": \"workspace:*\" } }),","+    );","+    let n_version = || _utils::importer_version(&fixture.wanted(), \"packages/consumer\", \"n\");","+","+    fixture.run([\"install\"]);","+    assert_eq!(n_version(), \"link:../n\");","+","+    write(","+        \"consumer\",","+        serde_json::json!({","+            \"name\": \"consumer\",","+            \"dependencies\": { \"n\": \"workspace:*\", \"@pnpm.e2e/foo\": \"100.1.0\" },","+        }),","+    );","+    fixture.run([\"install\"]);","+    let incremental = n_version();","+    fs::remove_file(fixture.workspace.join(\"pnpm-lock.yaml\")).expect(\"remove the lockfile\");","+    fixture.run([\"install\"]);","+","+    assert_eq!(incremental, \"file:packages/n(@pnpm.e2e/foo@100.1.0)\");","+    assert_eq!(n_version(), incremental, \"a fresh install records the same copy\");","+}"],"additions":51,"deletions":4,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/tests/suite/peer_convergence.rs","lines":["@@ -616,24 +616,20 @@ fn workspace_package_with_a_peer() {","             project(\"a\", &[(\"lib\", \"workspace:*\"), (\"@pnpm.e2e/foo\", \"100.0.0\")]),","             project(\"b\", &[(\"lib\", \"workspace:*\"), (\"@pnpm.e2e/foo\", \"100.1.0\")]),","         ],","-        vec![","-            Divergence {","-                issue: INJECTED_BEFORE_PROVIDER_ISSUE,","-                rows: |row| row.inject_workspace_packages,","-                paths: &[","-                    \"importers > packages/a > dependencies > lib >\",","-                    \"importers > packages/b > dependencies > lib >\",","-                    \"snapshots > lib@file:\",","-                ],","-            },","-            Divergence {","-                issue: AUTO_INSTALLED_PEER_MOVES_ISSUE,","-                rows: |row| row.auto_install_peers && !row.auto_dedupe,","-                paths: &[\"importers > packages/lib > dependencies > @pnpm.e2e/foo >\"],","-            },","-        ],","+        vec![Divergence {","+            issue: AUTO_INSTALLED_PEER_MOVES_ISSUE,","+            rows: |row| row.auto_install_peers && !row.auto_dedupe,","+            // Whether an injected `lib` dedupes to `link:` compares its","+            // peer with `lib`'s own pick, so the injected entries follow","+            // that pick.","+            paths: &[","+                \"importers > packages/lib > dependencies > @pnpm.e2e/foo >\",","+                \"importers > packages/a > dependencies > lib >\",","+                \"importers > packages/b > dependencies > lib >\",","+                \"snapshots > lib@file:\",","+            ],","+        }],","     );"," }"," ","-const INJECTED_BEFORE_PROVIDER_ISSUE: &str = \"https://github.com/pnpm/pnpm/issues/17057\";"," const AUTO_INSTALLED_P